@startuml
title FEQ-D07 Fiscal-Gated ExitAuthorization Interaction
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Central PMS confirms payment finality;
:Evaluate fiscal gating mode;

if (Fiscal gating enabled?) then (yes)
  :Request fiscal issuance from resolved Site POS Server;
  if (Fiscal issuance succeeds and Central PMS records reference?) then (yes)
    :Central PMS may evaluate normal ExitAuthorization eligibility;
    :Central PMS may issue normal ExitAuthorization if all rules pass;
  else (pending/failed/unknown)
    :Create/update Fiscal Exception Queue case;
    :Block normal ExitAuthorization;
    :FEQ readback/retry/manual review proceeds;
    if (Approved manual release / continuity path?) then (yes)
      :Record separate manual release / continuity evidence;
      :Do not convert it into normal ExitAuthorization;
    else (no)
      :Remain blocked until fiscal prerequisite or approved exception policy is resolved;
    endif
  endif
else (readiness-only or disabled)
  :Record fiscal posture according to configured mode;
  :Do not enable production fiscal gating implicitly;
endif

:Gate/Exit consumes only Central PMS authorization;
:FEQ does not open gates or issue ExitAuthorization;\nmanual release/continuity is separate evidence;
stop
@enduml
